# devbox project contract for Orion (sourced by the devbox `build` command).
#
# Toolchain (.devbox/provision.sh): JDK 21 + Flutter (stable) + Android SDK
#   (platform android-34, build-tools 34.0.0), installed into the /opt/toolchain volume.
# Build (.devbox/build.sh): flutter build apk --release + flutter build web --release
#   → published to $SERVE_DIR as app.apk + web/.
# Recommended PROJECT_BRANCH: phase-1-map (set it in devbox.conf).
